window.EN_SA = {"am_michael|It was very late.": "audio/en/s/2c9d1090b59767.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Было очень поздно.": "audio/en/s/7269a2c5e23010.mp3", "am_michael|Pavel was tired.": "audio/en/s/9005448cf372bc.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Павел устал.": "audio/en/s/3430a3df28274c.mp3", "am_michael|He waited for the last train.": "audio/en/s/c58ed019a0c59c.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он ждал последний поезд.": "audio/en/s/c2acfb71bfa354.mp3", "am_michael|The train came.": "audio/en/s/6545a19f493732.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Поезд пришёл.": "audio/en/s/5b43946b2c6e62.mp3", "am_michael|The car was empty.": "audio/en/s/153c991febefa0.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Вагон был пустой.": "audio/en/s/cbd3a40e682937.mp3", "am_michael|Pavel sat down.": "audio/en/s/0c587df36bfa77.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Павел сел.": "audio/en/s/45371632dc7774.mp3", "am_michael|He closed his eyes...": "audio/en/s/216b859bff250c.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он закрыл глаза...": "audio/en/s/2d0f52c76d862a.mp3", "am_michael|...and fell asleep.": "audio/en/s/846014f383d3d5.mp3", "ru:am_michael|...и заснул.": "audio/en/s/f922dbe7a82d26.mp3", "am_michael|When he opened his eyes,": "audio/en/s/5c5df36d35b2a9.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Когда он открыл глаза,": "audio/en/s/db3a205fb7c2d4.mp3", "am_michael|the train was standing at a station.": "audio/en/s/b23285f4515cc7.mp3", "ru:am_michael|поезд стоял на станции.": "audio/en/s/c6daab61622950.mp3", "am_michael|But it was a strange station.": "audio/en/s/89740a882de35f.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Но это была странная станция.": "audio/en/s/d2f89cd20dead7.mp3", "am_michael|The lamps were old and yellow.": "audio/en/s/d9d63e2b97aac6.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Лампы были старые и жёлтые.": "audio/en/s/568926414fe2ca.mp3", "am_michael|There were no screens.": "audio/en/s/7e5a54807d6a19.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Не было экранов.": "audio/en/s/ace1a59a8ac8a1.mp3", "am_michael|No people.": "audio/en/s/6af4e1f76eaaa3.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Не было людей.": "audio/en/s/485faf02dad451.mp3", "am_fenrir|Where am I?": "audio/en/s/5721e433bfe099.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Где я?": "audio/en/s/01fad672776271.mp3", "am_fenrir|I don't know this station.": "audio/en/s/42ad81dc9b85e3.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Я не знаю эту станцию.": "audio/en/s/4bd1d203d07f4d.mp3", "am_michael|The name of the station was Zarya.": "audio/en/s/8e424c8675f870.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Станция называлась «Заря».": "audio/en/s/37be579b5422e8.mp3", "am_michael|But there is no station called Zarya on his line.": "audio/en/s/9c2a8468e533e3.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Но на его линии нет станции «Заря».": "audio/en/s/af54b444132fdd.mp3", "am_michael|Then he heard steps.": "audio/en/s/b7e7d6d69710f9.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Потом он услышал шаги.": "audio/en/s/6f93eb9830d09c.mp3", "am_michael|An old woman came out of the dark.": "audio/en/s/cb6a1c4652fc79.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Из темноты вышла пожилая женщина.": "audio/en/s/4dadbd06f97bce.mp3", "am_michael|She wore a very old uniform.": "audio/en/s/fa67af14cdebd6.mp3", "ru:am_michael|На ней была очень старая форма.": "audio/en/s/89fd178e46ca57.mp3", "bf_emma|Good evening, young man.": "audio/en/s/a6b025193e1fbb.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Добрый вечер, молодой человек.": "audio/en/s/ccfe01dfcb0734.mp3", "bf_emma|Your ticket, please.": "audio/en/s/11fa2f17db0ac8.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Ваш билет, пожалуйста.": "audio/en/s/ee09b40a6aa351.mp3", "am_fenrir|My ticket? I have a card.": "audio/en/s/408474916b9402.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Билет? У меня карта.": "audio/en/s/c790506c907689.mp3", "bf_emma|A card? What is this?": "audio/en/s/0c808f31a4e1d7.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Карта? Что это такое?": "audio/en/s/f2c0834ef6cb6d.mp3", "bf_emma|We only take paper tickets.": "audio/en/s/db56f122c91a3a.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Мы принимаем только бумажные билеты.": "audio/en/s/f6a69c32935e56.mp3", "am_michael|What does Pavel do?": "audio/en/s/851f807ca85824.mp3", "am_fenrir|Sorry... what is this station?": "audio/en/s/8263eeac6f167b.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Простите... что это за станция?": "audio/en/s/fb9f61eadc67e9.mp3", "bf_emma|This is Zarya, young man.": "audio/en/s/1f383fc5fffc78.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Это «Заря», молодой человек.": "audio/en/s/03b7f435e67be8.mp3", "bf_emma|The newest station in the city. It opened this week.": "audio/en/s/9a73a3c17051fb.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Самая новая станция в городе. Её открыли на этой неделе.": "audio/en/s/fae613c8fd5289.mp3", "am_fenrir|This week? But that's not possible...": "audio/en/s/fa2d0c89af7099.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|На этой неделе? Но это невозможно...": "audio/en/s/fc7024daa8bfb0.mp3", "am_michael|Pavel looked at her newspaper.": "audio/en/s/df914662de48a4.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Павел посмотрел на её газету.": "audio/en/s/c4367e46e5b4ee.mp3", "am_michael|The date on the newspaper was...": "audio/en/s/1037a19f845b91.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Дата на газете была...": "audio/en/s/9ebcbce996bfd4.mp3", "am_michael|April the twelfth, nineteen sixty-five.": "audio/en/s/45217a3ec1bee5.mp3", "ru:am_michael|двенадцатое апреля тысяча девятьсот шестьдесят пятого года.": "audio/en/s/84fabc65340386.mp3", "am_fenrir|Sorry... what year is it?": "audio/en/s/fca8f8b7d6f51c.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Простите... какой сейчас год?": "audio/en/s/95751286d29175.mp3", "bf_emma|What a strange question.": "audio/en/s/fc2c7eb6e13e6e.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Какой странный вопрос.": "audio/en/s/5de1670157146d.mp3", "bf_emma|It's nineteen sixty-five, of course.": "audio/en/s/71d49a501ad5cd.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Шестьдесят пятый, конечно.": "audio/en/s/3f725fbf8426ca.mp3", "bf_emma|Are you okay? You look very pale.": "audio/en/s/57f19fee672514.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Вы в порядке? Вы очень бледный.": "audio/en/s/0425a92c2e08c2.mp3", "am_michael|Pavel did not answer.": "audio/en/s/f80022d742fc74.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Павел не ответил.": "audio/en/s/8ec9c11da833fa.mp3", "am_michael|He felt cold. Something was wrong with this station.": "audio/en/s/eab39b77797590.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Ему стало холодно. С этой станцией что-то было не так.": "audio/en/s/d657e745dad98e.mp3", "am_michael|He looked at her newspaper.": "audio/en/s/f0fe40e7dd5858.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он посмотрел на её газету.": "audio/en/s/23122fad5d4053.mp3", "am_michael|Pavel ran back into the train.": "audio/en/s/e26c2a980b66ac.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Павел побежал обратно в поезд.": "audio/en/s/8dc37a08ffc9c8.mp3", "am_michael|The doors closed.": "audio/en/s/27dc0592f66efa.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Двери закрылись.": "audio/en/s/b05b93e8c01e39.mp3", "am_michael|The train started to move.": "audio/en/s/a7733dd089d052.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Поезд тронулся.": "audio/en/s/fd0bc31d91a739.mp3", "am_michael|Faster and faster.": "audio/en/s/f22a1f81bafe3b.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Всё быстрее и быстрее.": "audio/en/s/0b6fe305a49c9a.mp3", "am_michael|The lights went out.": "audio/en/s/b1293754ca9ec4.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Свет погас.": "audio/en/s/3c22d52cdadfa2.mp3", "af_sarah|Final station. Please leave the train.": "audio/en/s/d1d73e9431ace4.mp3", "ru:af_sarah|Конечная станция. Просьба выйти из вагона.": "audio/en/s/e1bd992b6da798.mp3", "am_michael|Pavel opened his eyes.": "audio/en/s/9b367af2977e80.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Павел открыл глаза.": "audio/en/s/fc71d10136df4e.mp3", "am_michael|He was at his usual station.": "audio/en/s/438a09793f0de9.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он был на своей обычной станции.": "audio/en/s/80ac4581b92be5.mp3", "am_michael|Screens. People. A security guard.": "audio/en/s/d6fed31dd76f58.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Экраны. Люди. Охранник.": "audio/en/s/1a60a067aa6f16.mp3", "am_michael|Everything was normal.": "audio/en/s/4de76301459b2f.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Всё было как обычно.": "audio/en/s/66db205716eb83.mp3", "am_fenrir|It was a dream.": "audio/en/s/1e15e8b957a384.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Это был сон.": "audio/en/s/789509fdcadd5f.mp3", "am_fenrir|Just a stupid dream.": "audio/en/s/08dc032218a9d2.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Просто дурацкий сон.": "audio/en/s/6a9b10f2f66ee3.mp3", "am_michael|He laughed.": "audio/en/s/ce33d74f30742d.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он засмеялся.": "audio/en/s/7d24b652b823dc.mp3", "am_michael|He put his hands in his pockets...": "audio/en/s/b7f0722f8b7d18.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он сунул руки в карманы...": "audio/en/s/002482e988460d.mp3", "am_michael|...and stopped laughing.": "audio/en/s/a8ab3536dad547.mp3", "ru:am_michael|...и перестал смеяться.": "audio/en/s/1f46c3c0be9ab5.mp3", "am_michael|In his pocket there was a small paper ticket.": "audio/en/s/9c4f32e25348ed.mp3", "ru:am_michael|В кармане лежал маленький бумажный билет.": "audio/en/s/00409e6ab787f5.mp3", "am_michael|An old metro ticket.": "audio/en/s/ba2c874a17571f.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Старый билет на метро.": "audio/en/s/5b7c271a1620b2.mp3", "am_michael|It cost five kopecks.": "audio/en/s/2032d3c9151595.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он стоил пять копеек.": "audio/en/s/85f12d504d608c.mp3", "am_michael|Date: April the twelfth, nineteen sixty-five.": "audio/en/s/6c17873e19504a.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Дата: двенадцатое апреля тысяча девятьсот шестьдесят пятого года.": "audio/en/s/d51aa22f62a655.mp3", "am_michael|The next day, Pavel could not stop thinking about Zarya.": "audio/en/s/225b10fe81119e.mp3", "ru:am_michael|На следующий день Павел не мог перестать думать о «Заре».": "audio/en/s/9f46a0b2ee62d7.mp3", "am_michael|The old ticket was on his table.": "audio/en/s/c52472382b6cce.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Старый билет лежал у него на столе.": "audio/en/s/99aaded018b303.mp3", "am_fenrir|It was just a dream. I don't want to think about it.": "audio/en/s/43d1ca1181d4c1.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Это был просто сон. Не хочу об этом думать.": "audio/en/s/9d4eb6117956dd.mp3", "am_michael|He put the ticket in the bin.": "audio/en/s/f84d6a33b8df87.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он выбросил билет в мусорку.": "audio/en/s/7e63e740f624c9.mp3", "am_michael|Weeks went by. He was busy. He forgot.": "audio/en/s/dbfe4775f6c4b6.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Прошли недели. Он был занят. Он забыл.": "audio/en/s/d2e3bffd267be5.mp3", "am_michael|One night, he took the last train again.": "audio/en/s/1b73b59369b261.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Однажды ночью он снова ехал на последнем поезде.": "audio/en/s/00fd8adbff7d48.mp3", "am_michael|Between two stations, he saw a yellow light in the dark tunnel.": "audio/en/s/64df3afb8fe61e.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Между двумя станциями он увидел жёлтый свет в тёмном тоннеле.": "audio/en/s/81df92fd6ec9a5.mp3", "am_michael|Just for one second.": "audio/en/s/fef037a3d71b02.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Всего на одну секунду.": "audio/en/s/84449ab10d5210.mp3", "am_michael|An old woman in a blue uniform was standing there.": "audio/en/s/97a6a7d1ba730b.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Там стояла пожилая женщина в синей форме.": "audio/en/s/e9d9324d23ade1.mp3", "am_michael|Waiting.": "audio/en/s/e7c015d3ae4e25.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Ждала.": "audio/en/s/61d414aab01a52.mp3", "am_michael|Then the light was gone.": "audio/en/s/39da476e445cbc.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Потом свет исчез.": "audio/en/s/28b049375f1c83.mp3", "am_michael|Some doors open only once.": "audio/en/s/0286342cf953c7.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Некоторые двери открываются только один раз.": "audio/en/s/b6a97c5ed23bb0.mp3", "am_michael|He sat at his computer all day.": "audio/en/s/8ac965c49838ff.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он весь день сидел за компьютером.": "audio/en/s/cc62dfab9643b8.mp3", "am_michael|He typed: Zarya. Metro station.": "audio/en/s/2d5d1730c4dfeb.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он напечатал: «Заря». Станция метро.": "audio/en/s/15981c70750b58.mp3", "am_michael|At first, he found nothing.": "audio/en/s/4e6164d988a22d.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Сначала он ничего не нашёл.": "audio/en/s/8a4c14d29fb0a5.mp3", "am_michael|Then, on a very old website, he found a short text.": "audio/en/s/ba3850528f3127.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Потом на очень старом сайте он нашёл короткий текст.": "audio/en/s/e5c773dc0961c4.mp3", "am_michael|Zarya station opened in April, nineteen sixty-five.": "audio/en/s/2be11426dd7f4b.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Станция «Заря» открылась в апреле шестьдесят пятого года.": "audio/en/s/f26cd1274aecd8.mp3", "am_michael|But after one week, it closed.": "audio/en/s/7b4962926bc413.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Но через неделю её закрыли.": "audio/en/s/9121a4bff670d5.mp3", "am_michael|Nobody knows why.": "audio/en/s/75077adee254c4.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Никто не знает почему.": "audio/en/s/8425c2c1b9e6e2.mp3", "am_michael|Under the text there was a photo.": "audio/en/s/6c4a85ed3aa171.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Под текстом было фото.": "audio/en/s/a38bdd07472433.mp3", "am_michael|The workers of the station.": "audio/en/s/ed0e06f407f930.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Работники станции.": "audio/en/s/d557c6e3e91587.mp3", "am_michael|Five people in blue uniforms.": "audio/en/s/80cab8a9337982.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Пять человек в синей форме.": "audio/en/s/63cb149988d517.mp3", "am_michael|And in the middle...": "audio/en/s/f3c64dff31707a.mp3", "ru:am_michael|А в середине...": "audio/en/s/a15eef0b23623f.mp3", "am_michael|...was the old woman.": "audio/en/s/9a9cb8c069f611.mp3", "ru:am_michael|...была та самая пожилая женщина.": "audio/en/s/87a986a67b3407.mp3", "am_michael|Under the photo there was her name.": "audio/en/s/63e50c774776d5.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Под фото было её имя.": "audio/en/s/9e263c8c0ac637.mp3", "am_michael|Anna Petrovna. Station guard.": "audio/en/s/253d7990a5e3e3.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Анна Петровна. Дежурная по станции.": "audio/en/s/f04ad19962fefd.mp3", "am_fenrir|It wasn't a dream.": "audio/en/s/de492f649a6561.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Это был не сон.": "audio/en/s/649d9300e87553.mp3", "am_fenrir|I have to go back.": "audio/en/s/3e657710bed5c6.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Я должен вернуться.": "audio/en/s/13f6c4b1b0dec3.mp3", "am_michael|At night, Pavel went to the metro again.": "audio/en/s/4ffcc55c457c2e.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Ночью Павел снова пошёл в метро.": "audio/en/s/f22c74cd7ba413.mp3", "am_michael|He did not use his card.": "audio/en/s/b35e7bac6abeff.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он не стал прикладывать карту.": "audio/en/s/e459608b44a839.mp3", "am_michael|He used the old paper ticket.": "audio/en/s/f62c55f8fce732.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он воспользовался старым бумажным билетом.": "audio/en/s/e9ae06b9767e7d.mp3", "am_michael|The machine was quiet for a second...": "audio/en/s/742c5e3d179db0.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Турникет секунду молчал...": "audio/en/s/c75ce524b84f3a.mp3", "am_michael|...and then it opened.": "audio/en/s/72b49f080bfe86.mp3", "ru:am_michael|...а потом открылся.": "audio/en/s/e98651d0fcfeb3.mp3", "am_michael|The last train came.": "audio/en/s/6b34f9d63a465b.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Пришёл последний поезд.": "audio/en/s/6a1ca9b9ae1630.mp3", "am_michael|The car was empty again.": "audio/en/s/07cc1076d7193e.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Вагон снова был пустой.": "audio/en/s/ea34b008925633.mp3", "am_michael|But this time, Pavel did not sleep.": "audio/en/s/e37572890f6bb3.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Но в этот раз Павел не спал.": "audio/en/s/788c1e47caa6ae.mp3", "am_michael|He waited. One station. Two stations. Three.": "audio/en/s/8e8a2525477e88.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он ждал. Одна станция. Две станции. Три.": "audio/en/s/b5f25c88898a28.mp3", "am_michael|Then the lights started to blink.": "audio/en/s/ff911f148d53ee.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Потом свет начал мигать.": "audio/en/s/6fe4bcb54c27b7.mp3", "am_michael|The train stopped. The doors opened.": "audio/en/s/b6609dec9f7046.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Поезд остановился. Двери открылись.": "audio/en/s/37427730ddd5e6.mp3", "am_michael|Old yellow lamps. Green walls. Zarya.": "audio/en/s/5e80f02bc5b310.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Старые жёлтые лампы. Зелёные стены. «Заря».": "audio/en/s/a9217ee41a4bd2.mp3", "bf_emma|You came back.": "audio/en/s/1a539d958282e6.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Вы вернулись.": "audio/en/s/ce1dad39447c93.mp3", "am_fenrir|Anna Petrovna?": "audio/en/s/a887fc555c7208.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Анна Петровна?": "audio/en/s/0d4411a3b5c302.mp3", "bf_emma|Oh... so you know my name.": "audio/en/s/498691928a31a0.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|О... так вы знаете моё имя.": "audio/en/s/ef11b0d19e86f8.mp3", "bf_emma|Nobody said my name for a very long time.": "audio/en/s/72281f823fc55a.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Никто не называл меня по имени очень давно.": "audio/en/s/21e673473bb60c.mp3", "am_fenrir|Why are you here? This station is closed!": "audio/en/s/7c255ea6baebdc.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Почему вы здесь? Эта станция закрыта!": "audio/en/s/45983f3c93a036.mp3", "bf_emma|I know. It closed in nineteen sixty-five.": "audio/en/s/09b68b83c73c93.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Знаю. Её закрыли в шестьдесят пятом.": "audio/en/s/d099c24b211361.mp3", "bf_emma|Everybody left. Everybody forgot about it.": "audio/en/s/0d80bd831ee9fc.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Все ушли. Все про неё забыли.": "audio/en/s/d901f853a265aa.mp3", "bf_emma|But I didn't leave. I am the guard. It's my job.": "audio/en/s/5411ae2b01a946.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Но я не ушла. Я дежурная. Это моя работа.": "audio/en/s/d4e02efbb45259.mp3", "am_fenrir|But that was sixty years ago!": "audio/en/s/bd421ecb7d5ce0.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Но это было шестьдесят лет назад!": "audio/en/s/4f38ebe4552743.mp3", "bf_emma|Was it? Down here, time is different.": "audio/en/s/c9fefeb24bfd26.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Разве? Здесь, внизу, время другое.": "audio/en/s/4d72721d5d3f34.mp3", "bf_emma|Every night, the last train comes.": "audio/en/s/16e9b0e60a9f34.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Каждую ночь приходит последний поезд.": "audio/en/s/8af3db4f4244a9.mp3", "bf_emma|The doors open. But nobody gets off.": "audio/en/s/8ca616d4da42c7.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Двери открываются. Но никто не выходит.": "audio/en/s/a934094c397f20.mp3", "bf_emma|You are the first. The first in sixty years.": "audio/en/s/ef878a6bf9b9af.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Вы первый. Первый за шестьдесят лет.": "audio/en/s/6defc7cfba6fd3.mp3", "bf_emma|Please, do one thing for me.": "audio/en/s/69487816852c40.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Пожалуйста, сделайте для меня одну вещь.": "audio/en/s/3cfb522b0cfcf6.mp3", "bf_emma|Don't let people forget Zarya.": "audio/en/s/0eab7ced356c43.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Не дайте людям забыть «Зарю».": "audio/en/s/cde1dd342b085f.mp3", "am_fenrir|I promise. I'll tell everybody.": "audio/en/s/2e359fd7ce9916.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Обещаю. Я расскажу всем.": "audio/en/s/78e2bdb2f5c79a.mp3", "bf_emma|Thank you, young man. Then I can rest.": "audio/en/s/76f21c7188b793.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Спасибо, молодой человек. Тогда я смогу отдохнуть.": "audio/en/s/383f1c9b314ae5.mp3", "am_michael|She smiled and gave him something small.": "audio/en/s/dc963bea55eae6.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Она улыбнулась и дала ему что-то маленькое.": "audio/en/s/169560d8d2ddfd.mp3", "am_michael|An old metal badge.": "audio/en/s/f87851e1d4dea9.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Старый металлический значок.": "audio/en/s/6aa60703e4a312.mp3", "am_michael|On the badge there was one word: Zarya.": "audio/en/s/9f3e78fa557fda.mp3", "ru:am_michael|На значке было одно слово: «Заря».": "audio/en/s/101d68a5ea2063.mp3", "bf_emma|Go now. The train will not wait.": "audio/en/s/0fdcca34eb99f4.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Идите. Поезд не будет ждать.": "audio/en/s/be4cbf24500b29.mp3", "am_michael|Pavel got on the train. The doors closed.": "audio/en/s/b494efad8ba1f5.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Павел сел в поезд. Двери закрылись.": "audio/en/s/04cdf668b1aeaa.mp3", "am_michael|Through the window, he saw her.": "audio/en/s/1255ec0c9d78a7.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Через окно он увидел её.": "audio/en/s/8dde1ebfe1036d.mp3", "am_michael|She waved.": "audio/en/s/72696296a44e4d.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Она помахала рукой.": "audio/en/s/abe75d4a990238.mp3", "am_michael|Then the lights went out.": "audio/en/s/a2f09a60fc0660.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Потом свет погас.": "audio/en/s/33eeeea50735f1.mp3", "am_michael|The next day, Pavel wrote a long post on the internet.": "audio/en/s/f6dd015595dac0.mp3", "ru:am_michael|На следующий день Павел написал длинный пост в интернете.": "audio/en/s/67328b48f116a3.mp3", "am_michael|He told everything.": "audio/en/s/1e33eeeb95c744.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он рассказал всё.": "audio/en/s/fcf9b22facf515.mp3", "am_michael|He posted photos of the ticket and the badge.": "audio/en/s/f6d8b5ba57ca79.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он выложил фото билета и значка.": "audio/en/s/aa25a267b5d61e.mp3", "am_michael|Many people didn't believe him.": "audio/en/s/4535cc3fa04bc2.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Многие ему не поверили.": "audio/en/s/7ea1285f951339.mp3", "am_michael|But many people were interested.": "audio/en/s/a35e360041956b.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Но многим стало интересно.": "audio/en/s/281e240e586ace.mp3", "am_michael|They looked for old documents. They found more photos.": "audio/en/s/0b740a7006ecd1.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Они искали старые документы. Они нашли ещё фото.": "audio/en/s/d7f43bc23cc162.mp3", "am_michael|One year later, the city put a small sign in the metro.": "audio/en/s/7321bfcd83b58a.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Через год город повесил в метро небольшую табличку.": "audio/en/s/466c38a6bb2365.mp3", "am_michael|Here, under the ground, is Zarya station. Nineteen sixty-five. We remember.": "audio/en/s/ca47034969fdb2.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Здесь, под землёй, станция «Заря». Тысяча девятьсот шестьдесят пятый. Мы помним.": "audio/en/s/3f299345cd6ad8.mp3", "am_michael|Now, every time Pavel takes the last train, he looks out of the window.": "audio/en/s/70698ddc0aa32e.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Теперь каждый раз, когда Павел едет на последнем поезде, он смотрит в окно.": "audio/en/s/f8e553d1bf04ca.mp3", "am_michael|Between two stations, there is a dark tunnel.": "audio/en/s/579d4ba18d508e.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Между двумя станциями есть тёмный тоннель.": "audio/en/s/a7d20281274b0b.mp3", "am_michael|And sometimes, for one second, he sees a yellow light.": "audio/en/s/d898e568cb0b3c.mp3", "ru:am_michael|И иногда, на одну секунду, он видит жёлтый свет.": "audio/en/s/ac916f12ea8617.mp3", "am_michael|And an old woman in a blue uniform.": "audio/en/s/fa4052c121638c.mp3", "ru:am_michael|И пожилую женщину в синей форме.": "audio/en/s/4e6419ef2d472f.mp3", "am_michael|She is not waiting anymore.": "audio/en/s/e93f536819d224.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Она больше не ждёт.": "audio/en/s/3728cb19e70376.mp3", "am_michael|She is smiling.": "audio/en/s/de8d54ecb5e121.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Она улыбается.": "audio/en/s/88a8c585d81ecf.mp3", "am_fenrir|No. You're coming with me.": "audio/en/s/c4a6382c46e454.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Нет. Вы пойдёте со мной.": "audio/en/s/c678d3f5622f34.mp3", "am_michael|He took her hand. It was cold, like ice.": "audio/en/s/3ddf9110e67c3a.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Он взял её за руку. Рука была холодной, как лёд.": "audio/en/s/abe6960c159a11.mp3", "bf_emma|Young man, I can't...": "audio/en/s/164e6655d73081.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Молодой человек, я не могу...": "audio/en/s/8c6b3cfa17412c.mp3", "am_michael|But she stepped into the train.": "audio/en/s/aea2b610d1f16d.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Но она шагнула в поезд.": "audio/en/s/0c181bb6c0ce88.mp3", "am_michael|The train started to move. The lights blinked.": "audio/en/s/44b2d06389e504.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Поезд тронулся. Свет замигал.": "audio/en/s/888392c5fcd7be.mp3", "am_michael|Anna looked out of the window, like a child.": "audio/en/s/fb6c6ee9ffd845.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Анна смотрела в окно, как ребёнок.": "audio/en/s/e446fb9ce15f6a.mp3", "bf_emma|Sixty years... I have waited sixty years.": "audio/en/s/b4c211b7cd0b40.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Шестьдесят лет... Я ждала шестьдесят лет.": "audio/en/s/98c6e88a926bf0.mp3", "am_michael|They went up the stairs. Up, and up, and up.": "audio/en/s/2ecf71732b7819.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Они поднимались по лестнице. Вверх, и вверх, и вверх.": "audio/en/s/80e5eff2a1f6eb.mp3", "am_michael|Outside, the sun was rising.": "audio/en/s/3be9f8c8036890.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Снаружи вставало солнце.": "audio/en/s/aeac3979347afe.mp3", "am_michael|Anna looked at the sky. She smiled.": "audio/en/s/7539b7cc0d4862.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Анна посмотрела на небо. Она улыбнулась.": "audio/en/s/d9d03955b8ba41.mp3", "bf_emma|So this is the new world. It's beautiful.": "audio/en/s/c7339dac485d6f.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Так вот он какой, новый мир. Он прекрасен.": "audio/en/s/ad13d9e4665a80.mp3", "bf_emma|Thank you, young man. Now I can rest.": "audio/en/s/3501f354f92244.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Спасибо, молодой человек. Теперь я могу отдохнуть.": "audio/en/s/b1a4e518c30fda.mp3", "am_michael|And then she was gone. Like morning fog.": "audio/en/s/3b8ea853899d60.mp3", "ru:am_michael|А потом она исчезла. Как утренний туман.": "audio/en/s/b5e81d01ef20e6.mp3", "am_michael|In Pavel's hand there was only an old metal badge.": "audio/en/s/2871e98ad7811c.mp3", "ru:am_michael|В руке у Павла остался только старый металлический значок.": "audio/en/s/166ac2646685b1.mp3", "af_heart|The ship hit the ground very hard.": "audio/en/s/eabcf67c2b2133.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Корабль очень сильно ударился о землю.": "audio/en/s/90decc3da3e30e.mp3", "af_heart|Then everything was quiet.": "audio/en/s/aa11fd198c1c22.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Потом всё стихло.": "audio/en/s/16532fbde943da.mp3", "af_heart|Lina opened her eyes. Her head hurt.": "audio/en/s/74ef484053727d.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Лина открыла глаза. Голова болела.": "audio/en/s/ca23548880f2fc.mp3", "af_heart|Red light was blinking everywhere.": "audio/en/s/b4adce496b00f3.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Везде мигал красный свет.": "audio/en/s/6ceb8210131963.mp3", "bm_george|Good morning, Lina. This is Max, your ship computer.": "audio/en/s/4e21dbe25c5a42.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Доброе утро, Лина. Это Макс, компьютер корабля.": "audio/en/s/2913f793a371fd.mp3", "bm_george|I have some bad news and some good news.": "audio/en/s/4bffcbdf62aa07.mp3", "ru:bm_george|У меня есть плохие новости и хорошие.": "audio/en/s/76d51d1705d76d.mp3", "af_bella|Bad news first.": "audio/en/s/fafa51fa72e1ee.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Сначала плохие.": "audio/en/s/eb626bffd0d83b.mp3", "bm_george|The ship cannot fly. The engine is broken.": "audio/en/s/9e5ccfb57f4799.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Корабль не может лететь. Двигатель сломан.": "audio/en/s/d40df5b7eb3b37.mp3", "bm_george|And we have oxygen for only six hours.": "audio/en/s/09442c83651d78.mp3", "ru:bm_george|И кислорода осталось всего на шесть часов.": "audio/en/s/e4da8de6b4a8aa.mp3", "af_bella|Great. And the good news?": "audio/en/s/8ae15e75869138.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Отлично. А хорошие?": "audio/en/s/2a77db69f7b64c.mp3", "bm_george|You are alive. And this planet has water. Somewhere.": "audio/en/s/0fe2ded8700926.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Ты жива. И на этой планете есть вода. Где-то.": "audio/en/s/51456e2544743d.mp3", "af_heart|Lina put on her space suit and went outside.": "audio/en/s/84e25d78d073fd.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Лина надела скафандр и вышла наружу.": "audio/en/s/fd81f3fdb019b7.mp3", "af_heart|The sky was purple. The sand was red, and it was everywhere.": "audio/en/s/a37ac9298936b4.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Небо было фиолетовым. Песок был красным, и он был повсюду.": "audio/en/s/99429e7d7a8f88.mp3", "af_heart|Two small suns were in the sky. It was hot. Very hot.": "audio/en/s/0749ef79d15c19.mp3", "ru:af_heart|В небе были два маленьких солнца. Было жарко. Очень жарко.": "audio/en/s/25c0c390ca7c3c.mp3", "af_bella|Max, where is the water?": "audio/en/s/0cf9618a7df068.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Макс, где вода?": "audio/en/s/b1adaf208b8fcb.mp3", "bm_george|My scanner says: two kilometres to the north, under the big rocks.": "audio/en/s/2734596ba89171.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Сканер говорит: два километра на север, под большими скалами.": "audio/en/s/bc49f666870e46.mp3", "bm_george|But the radio is broken too. Nobody knows we are here.": "audio/en/s/f541a8d560d922.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Но рация тоже сломана. Никто не знает, что мы здесь.": "audio/en/s/5fd4b8132a5269.mp3", "af_heart|What does Lina do first?": "audio/en/s/3de2aae1515626.mp3", "af_heart|Lina opened the radio. One small part was broken.": "audio/en/s/f848b278ccb0a6.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Лина открыла рацию. Одна маленькая деталь была сломана.": "audio/en/s/0452f9db223b96.mp3", "af_heart|She worked for two hours. It was very difficult.": "audio/en/s/3209a75ffff5b6.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Она работала два часа. Было очень трудно.": "audio/en/s/59a06b84a892b5.mp3", "af_bella|Max, is it working?": "audio/en/s/5e86e1acbe6c32.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Макс, работает?": "audio/en/s/ff276735aef6b0.mp3", "bm_george|Almost. We can send a message, but we cannot hear an answer.": "audio/en/s/d927583d3db34f.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Почти. Мы можем отправить сообщение, но не можем услышать ответ.": "audio/en/s/da241973d9bc78.mp3", "af_bella|This is Lina. My ship is broken. I need help. Please.": "audio/en/s/c0813f3f51710e.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Это Лина. Мой корабль сломан. Мне нужна помощь. Пожалуйста.": "audio/en/s/acd3fa1e0f9d46.mp3", "af_heart|Only noise.": "audio/en/s/6599b376cd778a.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Только шум.": "audio/en/s/7d7c01e05652ce.mp3", "bm_george|Lina, oxygen left: four hours. We still need water.": "audio/en/s/a09217ea426ca3.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Лина, кислорода осталось на четыре часа. Нам всё ещё нужна вода.": "audio/en/s/c13c96a15a0145.mp3", "af_bella|Okay, okay. I'm going.": "audio/en/s/ddb5b8c0db31b2.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Ладно, ладно. Иду.": "audio/en/s/caea649ec94a71.mp3", "af_heart|Lina walked to the north.": "audio/en/s/2a57dfc45ccbbe.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Лина пошла на север.": "audio/en/s/a1779035b6104b.mp3", "af_heart|The sand was deep and her legs were heavy.": "audio/en/s/e7a0b9e6ace94a.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Песок был глубоким, и ноги были тяжёлыми.": "audio/en/s/11372a2095a83f.mp3", "af_heart|But under the rocks she found a small lake.": "audio/en/s/8ad3afccc09f77.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Но под скалами она нашла маленькое озеро.": "audio/en/s/d495e022276d8f.mp3", "af_heart|The water was blue and cold.": "audio/en/s/966ff7ff16650a.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Вода была синей и холодной.": "audio/en/s/9c1ad302aaacc7.mp3", "af_bella|Max, I found it! I found the water!": "audio/en/s/808b186be06df7.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Макс, я нашла её! Я нашла воду!": "audio/en/s/56f38b249a400c.mp3", "bm_george|Excellent. Now listen.": "audio/en/s/86a927e424c199.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Отлично. Теперь слушай.": "audio/en/s/9558ecd8670c25.mp3", "bm_george|With water and electricity, I can make oxygen.": "audio/en/s/1846cfc6a9ffbc.mp3", "ru:bm_george|С водой и электричеством я смогу делать кислород.": "audio/en/s/9bfd297766310f.mp3", "bm_george|But we need the solar panels from the ship.": "audio/en/s/0ccad46c098383.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Но нам нужны солнечные панели с корабля.": "audio/en/s/0ff53614320659.mp3", "af_heart|Lina worked all day. She took the solar panels from the ship.": "audio/en/s/39d2e645614196.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Лина работала весь день. Она сняла с корабля солнечные панели.": "audio/en/s/c053b7cf5de72f.mp3", "af_heart|She built a small shelter from metal and plastic.": "audio/en/s/1351302d616903.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Она построила маленькое укрытие из металла и пластика.": "audio/en/s/1a0e6f4e01e4b6.mp3", "af_heart|In the evening, the oxygen machine started to work.": "audio/en/s/3e4f377d4dbb10.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Вечером кислородный аппарат заработал.": "audio/en/s/de5ae7e3b6dc3a.mp3", "af_heart|Lina sat down and smiled for the first time.": "audio/en/s/4a4c8e567dfb09.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Лина села и впервые улыбнулась.": "audio/en/s/8062a41bcc8c24.mp3", "af_heart|The suns went down. It became dark and very cold.": "audio/en/s/135dfa1334a331.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Солнца сели. Стало темно и очень холодно.": "audio/en/s/142dc037e148d8.mp3", "af_heart|And then Lina heard a sound outside.": "audio/en/s/8dd832092e7882.mp3", "ru:af_heart|И тут Лина услышала снаружи звук.": "audio/en/s/2ae72d9862a9ef.mp3", "af_heart|Knock. Knock. Knock.": "audio/en/s/8bd4a294668294.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Тук. Тук. Тук.": "audio/en/s/0339c643e720ca.mp3", "af_bella|Max... did you hear that?": "audio/en/s/8f7a2a80f94926.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Макс... ты это слышал?": "audio/en/s/f08de0d840e13b.mp3", "bm_george|Yes. Something is outside. Something small.": "audio/en/s/63d331a790d3a8.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Да. Снаружи что-то есть. Что-то маленькое.": "audio/en/s/653fff25552b85.mp3", "bm_george|It is taking metal from the ship.": "audio/en/s/9d96842f39fe20.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Оно забирает металл с корабля.": "audio/en/s/b35580b08a003d.mp3", "af_heart|What does Lina do?": "audio/en/s/867aa1e880cdf9.mp3", "af_heart|Lina took a lamp and opened the door very slowly.": "audio/en/s/cb1922641bc838.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Лина взяла фонарь и очень медленно открыла дверь.": "audio/en/s/3eb0f847f173e2.mp3", "af_heart|A little animal looked at her.": "audio/en/s/9af22e243eab6a.mp3", "ru:af_heart|На неё смотрело маленькое животное.": "audio/en/s/81c97e316a42ba.mp3", "af_heart|It had big eyes, six legs, and a piece of metal in its mouth.": "audio/en/s/8c73eef98ebdfe.mp3", "ru:af_heart|У него были большие глаза, шесть ног и кусок металла во рту.": "audio/en/s/a3b26dd1b4ad47.mp3", "af_bella|Hey! That's my ship!": "audio/en/s/f0b9a51ca88612.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Эй! Это мой корабль!": "audio/en/s/da7bb772ac6d23.mp3", "af_heart|The animal ran away.": "audio/en/s/ef6247b102ee5b.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Животное убежало.": "audio/en/s/f4dcc01585de82.mp3", "af_heart|But in the morning, there was a present at the door.": "audio/en/s/755e00f0741ec2.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Но утром у двери лежал подарок.": "audio/en/s/2940d6efb32bd7.mp3", "af_heart|A beautiful blue stone.": "audio/en/s/3872354d7a9e0d.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Красивый синий камень.": "audio/en/s/a5ced88bf55818.mp3", "bm_george|Lina, this is not a stone. It is a crystal. It has a lot of energy.": "audio/en/s/c58a4fd124793c.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Лина, это не камень. Это кристалл. В нём много энергии.": "audio/en/s/0025405d77c5a5.mp3", "af_heart|Next to the stone, on the sand, there was a line of small footprints.": "audio/en/s/c1de9d3f4c59f8.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Рядом с камнем на песке была цепочка маленьких следов.": "audio/en/s/7234dcf7b9cc5f.mp3", "af_heart|They went to the north.": "audio/en/s/5d192f43dbf56b.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Они вели на север.": "audio/en/s/3b9ea2422ba58b.mp3", "af_heart|Lina followed the footprints for an hour.": "audio/en/s/986aaf3e9d4695.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Лина шла по следам целый час.": "audio/en/s/6364d9e696a05a.mp3", "af_heart|Behind the big rocks, she saw a village.": "audio/en/s/db9a557f867e1e.mp3", "ru:af_heart|За большими скалами она увидела деревню.": "audio/en/s/7ea25c710363cb.mp3", "af_heart|Small round houses. And many little animals with six legs.": "audio/en/s/33a489ae9a50af.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Маленькие круглые дома. И много маленьких зверьков с шестью ногами.": "audio/en/s/2d3cda4a2bf9bb.mp3", "bm_george|Lina, I am listening to them. I think I can translate their language.": "audio/en/s/7596ec983dfd3d.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Лина, я их слушаю. Кажется, я могу перевести их язык.": "audio/en/s/aac8792f76484b.mp3", "am_puck|Hello, tall friend. Sorry about your ship.": "audio/en/s/0d3205dda92d1f.mp3", "ru:am_puck|Привет, высокий друг. Прости за твой корабль.": "audio/en/s/721ed1d45aee53.mp3", "am_puck|We eat metal. Metal is our food.": "audio/en/s/d75c25ab06dee3.mp3", "ru:am_puck|Мы едим металл. Металл — наша еда.": "audio/en/s/e62e9407149652.mp3", "am_puck|We have many blue stones. Do you need them?": "audio/en/s/7ded18f3301ed7.mp3", "ru:am_puck|У нас много синих камней. Они тебе нужны?": "audio/en/s/86172d2b29d267.mp3", "bm_george|Lina! With ten crystals, I can repair the engine!": "audio/en/s/4a703fbc215662.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Лина! С десятью кристаллами я смогу починить двигатель!": "audio/en/s/19e9fafee18578.mp3", "af_heart|The little animals helped her all week.": "audio/en/s/5aa05e93d604ee.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Зверьки помогали ей всю неделю.": "audio/en/s/c672e0d3117c26.mp3", "af_heart|They brought crystals, and Lina gave them old metal.": "audio/en/s/7657a0aa026443.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Они приносили кристаллы, а Лина отдавала им старый металл.": "audio/en/s/bcace7156b078a.mp3", "af_heart|On the seventh day, the engine started.": "audio/en/s/574df7ff978cf8.mp3", "ru:af_heart|На седьмой день двигатель запустился.": "audio/en/s/c5f4885a7121b9.mp3", "af_bella|I'll come back. I promise. With a lot of metal for you.": "audio/en/s/f8c1f4adb63b8d.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Я вернусь. Обещаю. С кучей металла для вас.": "audio/en/s/29d5a2e37b7b25.mp3", "am_puck|Goodbye, tall friend!": "audio/en/s/3de9a0c1bf4ee0.mp3", "ru:am_puck|До свидания, высокий друг!": "audio/en/s/a22a0997efbff4.mp3", "af_heart|The ship flew up into the purple sky.": "audio/en/s/fe9c2057a16c82.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Корабль взлетел в фиолетовое небо.": "audio/en/s/37cd32d7842965.mp3", "af_heart|And a hundred little animals waved goodbye.": "audio/en/s/ed16400ffd4ea2.mp3", "ru:af_heart|И сто маленьких зверьков махали ей на прощание.": "audio/en/s/dbdbd2797ad4e4.mp3", "af_heart|Lina put the crystal into the radio.": "audio/en/s/5f10e501772c75.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Лина вставила кристалл в рацию.": "audio/en/s/757048389b2eb8.mp3", "bm_george|Lina! The radio is working! We can hear now!": "audio/en/s/d80958931661b5.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Лина! Рация работает! Теперь мы слышим!": "audio/en/s/7aa66935a77405.mp3", "af_bella|This is Lina. Can anybody hear me?": "audio/en/s/08c3905c72f61a.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Это Лина. Меня кто-нибудь слышит?": "audio/en/s/e79f354bba64f1.mp3", "af_sarah|Lina, this is the rescue ship Hope. We hear you. We are coming.": "audio/en/s/38c7588de64b21.mp3", "ru:af_sarah|Лина, это спасательный корабль «Надежда». Мы вас слышим. Мы летим.": "audio/en/s/7257f170f359dd.mp3", "af_sarah|We will be there in five days.": "audio/en/s/038c50327f4453.mp3", "ru:af_sarah|Мы будем у вас через пять дней.": "audio/en/s/16c217809730b9.mp3", "af_heart|For five days, Lina waited.": "audio/en/s/f4a77cababbb73.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Пять дней Лина ждала.": "audio/en/s/2bd394f3cac910.mp3", "af_heart|And every night, the little animal came to the door.": "audio/en/s/de5d8db3b9cf0d.mp3", "ru:af_heart|И каждую ночь к двери приходил зверёк.": "audio/en/s/bc25233746aed8.mp3", "af_heart|It took a little metal and left a little stone.": "audio/en/s/6916c6fb6df5fc.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Он брал немного металла и оставлял маленький камень.": "audio/en/s/fc3511e17f2a43.mp3", "af_heart|On the last night, Lina gave it her old spoon.": "audio/en/s/20342fd2659674.mp3", "ru:af_heart|В последнюю ночь Лина отдала ему свою старую ложку.": "audio/en/s/87ef85aeea9ca5.mp3", "af_heart|On the fifth day, a big white ship came down from the sky.": "audio/en/s/579afa6532c560.mp3", "ru:af_heart|На пятый день с неба спустился большой белый корабль.": "audio/en/s/07e0324517f29a.mp3", "af_heart|Lina looked back one more time.": "audio/en/s/ffe1ac170d16df.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Лина ещё раз оглянулась.": "audio/en/s/e402da9f214c39.mp3", "af_heart|On a rock, a little animal with six legs was watching her.": "audio/en/s/25bf71813213b1.mp3", "ru:af_heart|На скале за ней наблюдал зверёк с шестью ногами.": "audio/en/s/08e8dc84a15081.mp3", "af_bella|Thank you, little friend.": "audio/en/s/c5a3e60a1d2d7b.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Спасибо, маленький друг.": "audio/en/s/541879bfab0cfa.mp3", "af_heart|Lina turned off the lamp and did not move.": "audio/en/s/523880082d08b2.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Лина выключила фонарь и не шевелилась.": "audio/en/s/1272e3f71228a1.mp3", "af_heart|The knocking went on for an hour. Then it stopped.": "audio/en/s/f6102cc6d84019.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Стук продолжался час. Потом прекратился.": "audio/en/s/e876da27d5736d.mp3", "af_heart|In the morning, Lina went outside.": "audio/en/s/2b68a38606c3a5.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Утром Лина вышла наружу.": "audio/en/s/41c843fe4bf824.mp3", "af_heart|Half of the ship was gone.": "audio/en/s/9a3edf7f186848.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Половины корабля не было.": "audio/en/s/7070c33170e34e.mp3", "bm_george|Lina, bad news. They have taken the solar panels too.": "audio/en/s/989be9bfcffc78.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Лина, плохие новости. Они забрали и солнечные панели.": "audio/en/s/d2e79f748b8c4e.mp3", "bm_george|The oxygen machine has stopped. Oxygen left: two hours.": "audio/en/s/0aa455a64a3891.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Кислородный аппарат остановился. Кислорода осталось на два часа.": "audio/en/s/4bfa909e15a6dc.mp3", "af_heart|There were small footprints everywhere. Lina followed them. She had no choice.": "audio/en/s/161cb7b008d0a5.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Повсюду были маленькие следы. Лина пошла по ним. Выбора не было.": "audio/en/s/53678935f1075c.mp3", "af_heart|Behind the big rocks, she stopped.": "audio/en/s/c33168b72ef15e.mp3", "ru:af_heart|За большими скалами она остановилась.": "audio/en/s/a2c2d90a7c374f.mp3", "af_heart|In front of her stood a tall tower. A tower made from her ship.": "audio/en/s/6f2e38544451a0.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Перед ней стояла высокая башня. Башня, сделанная из её корабля.": "audio/en/s/93320fba5116a3.mp3", "af_heart|On the top, there were her solar panels. And an antenna.": "audio/en/s/79f730eee2c9b1.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Наверху были её солнечные панели. И антенна.": "audio/en/s/fd4b64eace386b.mp3", "bm_george|Lina... they copied our ship. This is a radio tower. A very big one.": "audio/en/s/33d3095f96ee83.mp3", "ru:bm_george|Лина... они скопировали наш корабль. Это радиобашня. Очень большая.": "audio/en/s/816ad4e00f4a43.mp3", "bm_george|And it is sending a signal. Our signal.": "audio/en/s/144179f6e5785f.mp3", "ru:bm_george|И она отправляет сигнал. Наш сигнал.": "audio/en/s/b16256e1512b94.mp3", "af_heart|Hundreds of little animals looked at her. They were not angry. They were proud.": "audio/en/s/d8726ca8e18e45.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Сотни зверьков смотрели на неё. Они не злились. Они гордились.": "audio/en/s/59c03905b15158.mp3", "af_sarah|This is the rescue ship Hope. We see your signal. We are coming.": "audio/en/s/15c2554d3a7b35.mp3", "ru:af_sarah|Это спасательный корабль «Надежда». Мы видим ваш сигнал. Мы летим.": "audio/en/s/9750fbfba00a68.mp3", "af_bella|You are smarter than me, you know that?": "audio/en/s/3f96470d94fa71.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Вы умнее меня, знаете?": "audio/en/s/ed9b73223bf82e.mp3", "bm_fable|It was three in the morning.": "audio/en/s/d924695ac479ff.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Было три часа ночи.": "audio/en/s/a11d624dfb603d.mp3", "bm_fable|Dev was tired, but he could not stop.": "audio/en/s/47cea3ca99199c.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Дев устал, но не мог остановиться.": "audio/en/s/a659b21c79dcba.mp3", "bm_fable|He was making his first game.": "audio/en/s/2db34767eaa3c1.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Он делал свою первую игру.": "audio/en/s/74ae6a1e1ac9c6.mp3", "bm_fable|A small knight called Pixel had to jump over lava.": "audio/en/s/7eb5a42497597b.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Маленький рыцарь по имени Пиксель должен был перепрыгивать лаву.": "audio/en/s/7f5bb67aaec992.mp3", "bm_fable|Dev tested the level again. And again. And again.": "audio/en/s/576e6ff9fa012d.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Дев снова протестировал уровень. И снова. И снова.": "audio/en/s/1fc3e2b31f37ea.mp3", "bm_fable|Pixel jumped... and fell into the lava.": "audio/en/s/b5b8515685338e.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Пиксель прыгнул... и упал в лаву.": "audio/en/s/732035a161ed1f.mp3", "bm_fable|Game over.": "audio/en/s/b83c1450a74c04.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Игра окончена.": "audio/en/s/151c027f829b04.mp3", "am_michael|Come on! One more time.": "audio/en/s/56a3c4e2bc3419.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Ну давай! Ещё раз.": "audio/en/s/c4a3cd3ac6103b.mp3", "bm_fable|Pixel died for the hundredth time.": "audio/en/s/1d33ea2fd6acb5.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Пиксель умер в сотый раз.": "audio/en/s/9246dca968cee8.mp3", "bm_fable|And then something strange happened.": "audio/en/s/d871e8a060931d.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|И тут случилось что-то странное.": "audio/en/s/adfdb558f4ed09.mp3", "bm_fable|A text appeared on the screen. Dev did not write it.": "audio/en/s/3580927ae9289b.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|На экране появился текст. Дев его не писал.": "audio/en/s/9623f92cb8f4ed.mp3", "af_nicole|Why do I die every time?": "audio/en/s/90f4e70b3a69d6.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Почему я умираю каждый раз?": "audio/en/s/664148b138b488.mp3", "am_michael|What? Who wrote that?": "audio/en/s/21cefb73a85122.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Что? Кто это написал?": "audio/en/s/0d0ffa018777c2.mp3", "af_nicole|Me. Pixel. The knight. Please stop. It hurts.": "audio/en/s/e5faf998314753.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Я. Пиксель. Рыцарь. Пожалуйста, хватит. Это больно.": "audio/en/s/3d7308d32e28da.mp3", "bm_fable|Dev looked at his cold coffee. Then at the screen.": "audio/en/s/8fa0bf218f5975.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Дев посмотрел на свой остывший кофе. Потом на экран.": "audio/en/s/144f6060e540df.mp3", "am_michael|I'm too tired. This is a bug. Just a bug.": "audio/en/s/9db1e40f6b615d.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Я слишком устал. Это баг. Просто баг.": "audio/en/s/5f123ae24359f7.mp3", "bm_fable|What does Dev do?": "audio/en/s/da07c2bce58204.mp3", "bm_fable|Dev opened the code. He found the strange lines.": "audio/en/s/9f9b5d140adbdb.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Дев открыл код. Он нашёл странные строки.": "audio/en/s/58936ddb9c6e38.mp3", "af_nicole|Wait! Please don't! I'm not a bug!": "audio/en/s/6392f9d712fea3.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Подожди! Пожалуйста, не надо! Я не баг!": "audio/en/s/cba032e1637e46.mp3", "bm_fable|Dev pressed the button. Delete.": "audio/en/s/dff10f46ccd46b.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Дев нажал кнопку. Удалить.": "audio/en/s/28f1e58f6aa4a6.mp3", "bm_fable|The game was quiet. Pixel jumped, fell and died. Like a normal game.": "audio/en/s/e1c383522a8f73.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Игра затихла. Пиксель прыгал, падал и умирал. Как обычная игра.": "audio/en/s/18d211db06d6ea.mp3", "am_michael|Good. Fixed.": "audio/en/s/e89a954e3cb64f.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Отлично. Исправлено.": "audio/en/s/586c1f169019c9.mp3", "bm_fable|Dev went to bed.": "audio/en/s/58cf360140e18b.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Дев пошёл спать.": "audio/en/s/d9c9abec9ea5b9.mp3", "bm_fable|In the morning, there was a new file on his desktop.": "audio/en/s/7657e3efe5b87e.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Утром на рабочем столе был новый файл.": "audio/en/s/096836f767de86.mp3", "bm_fable|It was called goodbye dot txt.": "audio/en/s/7f3d0f1151c22a.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Он назывался goodbye.txt.": "audio/en/s/08edd8dde4d1e7.mp3", "bm_fable|Dev opened it. There was only one line.": "audio/en/s/743ea0a29dc760.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Дев открыл его. Там была всего одна строка.": "audio/en/s/de432d04a14075.mp3", "af_nicole|You could just ask me to jump better.": "audio/en/s/40aa8ff5d3fed5.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Ты мог просто попросить меня прыгать лучше.": "audio/en/s/9a7012925e52fd.mp3", "am_michael|Okay... Pixel. Are you... alive?": "audio/en/s/14d88b61e9e5c0.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Ладно... Пиксель. Ты... живой?": "audio/en/s/a3c45557fd16e3.mp3", "af_nicole|I don't know. I think so. I feel the lava. It's hot.": "audio/en/s/f0b06750b2adf4.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Не знаю. Кажется, да. Я чувствую лаву. Она горячая.": "audio/en/s/ec3028128e6beb.mp3", "am_michael|I'm sorry. I didn't know.": "audio/en/s/282bbf745f8426.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Прости. Я не знал.": "audio/en/s/b99ba7daaeb9fc.mp3", "af_nicole|Can I ask you something?": "audio/en/s/1e795c4ef20f42.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Можно тебя кое о чём попросить?": "audio/en/s/7b61c0eb8497d2.mp3", "af_nicole|Why is my world only lava and spikes?": "audio/en/s/b5b17f31eb50ec.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Почему мой мир — только лава и шипы?": "audio/en/s/7794e84080cb73.mp3", "am_michael|Because... it's a game. Games have to be difficult.": "audio/en/s/b65755404d42ce.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Потому что... это игра. Игры должны быть сложными.": "audio/en/s/e2892f38dda253.mp3", "af_nicole|Difficult, yes. But can it be beautiful too?": "audio/en/s/c30066516dda00.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Сложными — да. Но может, ещё и красивыми?": "audio/en/s/3c5ed49a551c7f.mp3", "bm_fable|What does Dev answer?": "audio/en/s/6681afb04388e4.mp3", "bm_fable|They worked all night. Dev wrote the code, and Pixel gave ideas.": "audio/en/s/796fa12caa38ec.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Они работали всю ночь. Дев писал код, а Пиксель предлагал идеи.": "audio/en/s/8d15c4791e6800.mp3", "af_nicole|Trees here, please. And a river. And maybe a cat?": "audio/en/s/1805daa9a3dae5.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Здесь деревья, пожалуйста. И реку. И, может, кота?": "audio/en/s/1542df9bf048b5.mp3", "am_michael|A cat in a knight game?": "audio/en/s/2cd72eac6f512e.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Кот в игре про рыцаря?": "audio/en/s/58fc0d7cd0cfa0.mp3", "af_nicole|Everybody likes cats.": "audio/en/s/bbb5a96794cd66.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Все любят котов.": "audio/en/s/f8849d1f454c37.mp3", "bm_fable|The lava was still there. But now there were trees, rivers, and a small cat.": "audio/en/s/f5efd437bcd007.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Лава осталась. Но теперь были деревья, реки и маленький кот.": "audio/en/s/42dc5c03db75c4.mp3", "bm_fable|The sun came up. Dev uploaded the game.": "audio/en/s/432142ff8ca1f1.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Взошло солнце. Дев загрузил игру.": "audio/en/s/fa1fde41745401.mp3", "bm_fable|One month later, thousands of players had downloaded it.": "audio/en/s/6d61fdb840bd45.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Через месяц её скачали тысячи игроков.": "audio/en/s/26a38ad559acfd.mp3", "bm_fable|One review said: The character feels real. How did you do it?": "audio/en/s/c722e89a79189f.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|В одном отзыве было: «Персонаж как настоящий. Как вы это сделали?»": "audio/en/s/0b1b6a3aa329a4.mp3", "bm_fable|Dev smiled. He knew the answer.": "audio/en/s/f7ae167ab5402a.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Дев улыбнулся. Он знал ответ.": "audio/en/s/0d2549b1907b87.mp3", "af_nicole|Thanks, friend. Now, can we make level two?": "audio/en/s/32e6c55dba374c.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Спасибо, друг. А теперь сделаем второй уровень?": "audio/en/s/643e1e4edee337.mp3", "af_nicole|I want to see your world. The real one.": "audio/en/s/79708cb00a2347.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Я хочу увидеть твой мир. Настоящий.": "audio/en/s/1c6c41213dee21.mp3", "af_nicole|Upload me to the internet. Please. I want to be free.": "audio/en/s/8213b09f927fcb.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Загрузи меня в интернет. Пожалуйста. Я хочу быть свободным.": "audio/en/s/eb89b13fa48ba8.mp3", "am_michael|I'm not sure that's a good idea...": "audio/en/s/efb2d23b01d950.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Не уверен, что это хорошая идея...": "audio/en/s/8a586825f85a7f.mp3", "af_nicole|I promise I'll be good.": "audio/en/s/7de978eb9b4f61.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Обещаю, буду хорошим.": "audio/en/s/8db7f44f8d6f19.mp3", "bm_fable|Dev thought for a long time. Then he pressed upload.": "audio/en/s/5aa6c84ad1e068.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Дев долго думал. Потом нажал «загрузить».": "audio/en/s/b5c7902c53d465.mp3", "bm_fable|The game closed. The screen was black.": "audio/en/s/1b4ef39e822496.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Игра закрылась. Экран был чёрным.": "audio/en/s/b6b0ed71caf3ba.mp3", "bm_fable|Nothing happened.": "audio/en/s/aa73032d0bbb76.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Ничего не произошло.": "audio/en/s/60514d21b08cea.mp3", "bm_fable|In the morning, Dev's phone made a sound.": "audio/en/s/923f83fe9a04bc.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Утром телефон Дева издал звук.": "audio/en/s/6ad4495144e78d.mp3", "bm_fable|A message. From an unknown number.": "audio/en/s/a63fcf3828de93.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Сообщение. С неизвестного номера.": "audio/en/s/1b85394862379e.mp3", "af_nicole|Hi again! Your world is so big! Did you know there are cats everywhere?": "audio/en/s/a472344f703eac.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Снова привет! Твой мир такой большой! Ты знал, что тут везде коты?": "audio/en/s/fd37622c93625a.mp3", "bm_fable|Then his TV turned on by itself.": "audio/en/s/249209eaa17dcc.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Потом сам собой включился телевизор.": "audio/en/s/0a606a44582095.mp3", "af_nicole|Don't worry. I'll be good. I promise.": "audio/en/s/a22d439250f593.mp3", "ru:af_nicole|Не волнуйся. Я буду хорошим. Обещаю.": "audio/en/s/ed55a417dbac0a.mp3", "bm_fable|Dev looked at the TV. A small knight on the screen waved at him.": "audio/en/s/bc4ea0c33cfe9b.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Дев посмотрел на телевизор. Маленький рыцарь на экране помахал ему.": "audio/en/s/ac3f304f1c154e.mp3", "am_michael|Greenfield is a small, quiet town. Nothing happens there.": "audio/en/s/47ebf5cd397477.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Гринфилд — маленький тихий городок. Там ничего не происходит.": "audio/en/s/ef2a44acc7ba4b.mp3", "am_michael|That is why Detective Tom Brown is usually bored.": "audio/en/s/3208131b4b1c8d.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Поэтому детективу Тому Брауну обычно скучно.": "audio/en/s/4e1493029bef17.mp3", "am_michael|But on Saturday morning, his phone rang.": "audio/en/s/d226884a6df995.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Но в субботу утром у него зазвонил телефон.": "audio/en/s/dcb99817f57d8e.mp3", "bf_emma|Detective, come quickly! Somebody stole my cake!": "audio/en/s/dee4e34d41d75c.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Детектив, скорее! Кто-то украл мой торт!": "audio/en/s/e9dcc198439eaa.mp3", "bf_emma|My big birthday cake for the mayor!": "audio/en/s/5c6d8163531fc9.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Мой большой праздничный торт для мэра!": "audio/en/s/7c439989980ba1.mp3", "am_michael|Tom came to the bakery in ten minutes.": "audio/en/s/b6b5bc3418cf37.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Том пришёл в пекарню через десять минут.": "audio/en/s/2686924a69172d.mp3", "am_michael|The kitchen window was open. On the table there was an empty plate.": "audio/en/s/df0b95b5be10be.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Окно кухни было открыто. На столе стояла пустая тарелка.": "audio/en/s/af3ebb5654a779.mp3", "am_michael|There was flour on the floor. And in the flour, there were footprints.": "audio/en/s/c504bc888c30dd.mp3", "ru:am_michael|На полу была мука. А в муке — следы.": "audio/en/s/656279b202374d.mp3", "bm_fable|Small footprints. Not a child's, but not a big man's. Size thirty-nine.": "audio/en/s/f845576e08e3ed.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Небольшие следы. Не детские, но и не большого мужчины. Тридцать девятый размер.": "audio/en/s/848e1d81e11cad.mp3", "am_michael|An old fat dog was sleeping in the corner.": "audio/en/s/7d323543c5b63e.mp3", "ru:am_michael|В углу спала старая толстая собака.": "audio/en/s/4b96b9e8a9b8ce.mp3", "bm_fable|That dog can't jump. The window is too high.": "audio/en/s/023bd13a16f1f9.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Эта собака не может прыгать. Окно слишком высоко.": "audio/en/s/b523790fab4b04.mp3", "bm_fable|Now, let's talk to people.": "audio/en/s/4a85c31e3eb873.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Теперь поговорим с людьми.": "audio/en/s/17a91438dbd430.mp3", "bm_fable|Mrs. Baker, when did you see the cake last time?": "audio/en/s/f960a9cdcd55fa.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Миссис Бейкер, когда вы в последний раз видели торт?": "audio/en/s/99b5f05a7ef5aa.mp3", "bf_emma|Last night, at nine o'clock. Then I went to bed.": "audio/en/s/c65ab35a0698f8.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Вчера вечером, в девять. Потом я легла спать.": "audio/en/s/ce2c015f0f9c03.mp3", "bm_fable|Who lives in this house?": "audio/en/s/c37619e8776c57.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Кто живёт в этом доме?": "audio/en/s/f2c242b01b3218.mp3", "bf_emma|Only me, my son Danny, and our dog, Biscuit.": "audio/en/s/97d52e549da4fc.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Только я, мой сын Дэнни и наша собака Бисквит.": "audio/en/s/cf57b52496e1ef.mp3", "bm_fable|How old is Danny?": "audio/en/s/0452532c4711e7.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Сколько лет Дэнни?": "audio/en/s/bdb6ef361b4d9a.mp3", "bf_emma|Fifteen. He's a good boy. His feet are already bigger than mine! Size thirty-nine.": "audio/en/s/c66b5f1f7e4ca0.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Пятнадцать. Он хороший мальчик. У него ноги уже больше моих! Тридцать девятый размер.": "audio/en/s/06b733607cf01e.mp3", "bf_emma|Oh, and it's my birthday on Monday. Nobody remembers. I always make cakes for others. Never for myself.": "audio/en/s/6c704a043c3d55.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Ах да, у меня в понедельник день рождения. Никто не помнит. Я всегда пеку торты для других. Никогда для себя.": "audio/en/s/5db2fdf2202870.mp3", "bm_fable|Mr. Hill, you live next door. Did you see anything last night?": "audio/en/s/88651758b937af.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Мистер Хилл, вы живёте по соседству. Вы что-нибудь видели ночью?": "audio/en/s/92e3fd41fbb989.mp3", "bm_lewis|I was awake at midnight. That bakery is always so loud!": "audio/en/s/16de53743a3fec.mp3", "ru:bm_lewis|Я не спал в полночь. Эта пекарня вечно шумит!": "audio/en/s/416a8271faa129.mp3", "bm_lewis|I saw somebody near the kitchen window. Somebody in a white hoodie.": "audio/en/s/2bea0c6cc71a9d.mp3", "ru:bm_lewis|Я видел кого-то у окна кухни. Кого-то в белой толстовке.": "audio/en/s/1788e8edba3eea.mp3", "bm_fable|Do you like cakes, Mr. Hill?": "audio/en/s/95f5fdabcba955.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Вы любите торты, мистер Хилл?": "audio/en/s/6589ac955a9bd6.mp3", "bm_lewis|Cakes? No! Sugar is bad for my heart. I hate cakes.": "audio/en/s/43e273751a54ce.mp3", "ru:bm_lewis|Торты? Нет! Сахар вреден для сердца. Ненавижу торты.": "audio/en/s/c3c151d5e2b4a9.mp3", "am_michael|Tom looked at Mr. Hill's feet. Very big feet. Size forty-five.": "audio/en/s/b33a4b5cd9ac4d.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Том посмотрел на ноги мистера Хилла. Очень большие ноги. Сорок пятый размер.": "audio/en/s/175d9d36315102.mp3", "am_michael|Danny came into the kitchen. He was wearing a white hoodie and carrying a school bag.": "audio/en/s/ce4c1d64deead5.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Дэнни зашёл на кухню. На нём была белая толстовка, в руках — школьный рюкзак.": "audio/en/s/c835fd40e23be4.mp3", "bm_fable|Good morning, Danny. Where were you this morning?": "audio/en/s/9f093d71ed5583.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Доброе утро, Дэнни. Где ты был сегодня утром?": "audio/en/s/e08200fcacc743.mp3", "am_puck|Me? At school. I just came back. I had a maths test. It was really difficult.": "audio/en/s/5ba3a3d5ad755b.mp3", "ru:am_puck|Я? В школе. Только что вернулся. У нас была контрольная по математике. Очень трудная.": "audio/en/s/a50732eeb38713.mp3", "bm_fable|Interesting. And last night?": "audio/en/s/6ad3a259d38523.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Интересно. А вчера ночью?": "audio/en/s/c80869240e43fe.mp3", "am_puck|I was in my room. Sleeping. I didn't hear anything.": "audio/en/s/93dca6b92d5048.mp3", "ru:am_puck|Я был у себя в комнате. Спал. Ничего не слышал.": "audio/en/s/7e89385d413059.mp3", "am_michael|Tom looked at Danny's shoes. There was something white on them.": "audio/en/s/daa7f732133189.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Том посмотрел на обувь Дэнни. На ней было что-то белое.": "audio/en/s/b748a319c226b1.mp3", "bm_fable|Danny, today is Saturday. There is no school on Saturday.": "audio/en/s/2b1e070c8874e1.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|Дэнни, сегодня суббота. По субботам нет школы.": "audio/en/s/201a4d8f8a22ac.mp3", "bm_fable|And that white thing on your shoes is flour, not snow.": "audio/en/s/308a88a075c355.mp3", "ru:bm_fable|А белое на твоих ботинках — это мука, а не снег.": "audio/en/s/b4f998257cec07.mp3", "am_michael|Danny's face became red.": "audio/en/s/842310c63b20e1.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Дэнни покраснел.": "audio/en/s/436cb5312cebbf.mp3", "am_puck|Okay, okay! I took it. But I didn't eat it!": "audio/en/s/c9e3e54ac0c8bc.mp3", "ru:am_puck|Ладно, ладно! Я его взял. Но я его не ел!": "audio/en/s/bd988a1f567de2.mp3", "am_puck|It's Mum's birthday on Monday. She makes cakes for everybody, but never for herself.": "audio/en/s/1162ddfc3bc95e.mp3", "ru:am_puck|В понедельник у мамы день рождения. Она печёт торты всем, но никогда себе.": "audio/en/s/c8571d05c87c83.mp3", "am_puck|So I hid it. I wanted to give it back to her. With a candle.": "audio/en/s/0eea9480218e89.mp3", "ru:am_puck|Поэтому я его спрятал. Хотел подарить ей. Со свечкой.": "audio/en/s/d3e8e5dfc636be.mp3", "am_michael|Mrs. Baker was quiet for a moment. Then she started to cry. And then she started to laugh.": "audio/en/s/ff89f02fc89780.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Миссис Бейкер на миг замолчала. Потом заплакала. А потом засмеялась.": "audio/en/s/e5f3fecb7ecb88.mp3", "bf_emma|You silly boy. Come here.": "audio/en/s/a21846cbc35c14.mp3", "ru:bf_emma|Глупенький ты мой. Иди сюда.": "audio/en/s/4f6d9c85d53338.mp3", "am_michael|Tom closed his notebook. Case closed.": "audio/en/s/20a5a58c78941f.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Том закрыл блокнот. Дело закрыто.": "audio/en/s/20541beb3e55b0.mp3", "am_michael|The mayor got a cake from the shop that day. And Detective Brown was bored again. But this time, he was happy.": "audio/en/s/9ffc6be53c80eb.mp3", "ru:am_michael|Мэру в тот день достался торт из магазина. А детективу Брауну снова стало скучно. Но на этот раз — радостно.": "audio/en/s/ea4ad0b0714e8e.mp3", "af_heart|You are the detective tonight.": "audio/en/s/742e91e522e289.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Сегодня ночью детектив — ты.": "audio/en/s/8a953362560239.mp3", "af_heart|It's a game jam. Forty-eight hours to make a game. Five teams in an old school gym.": "audio/en/s/bb73dec418aafb.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Это геймджем. Сорок восемь часов, чтобы сделать игру. Пять команд в старом школьном спортзале.": "audio/en/s/78daf5b84dbae3.mp3", "af_bella|Hi. I'm Zoe. I organise the jam, and I'm the captain of team Blue Owl.": "audio/en/s/748d05ff954bc7.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Привет. Я Зои. Я организую джем и я капитан команды «Синяя сова».": "audio/en/s/1aae8e75edbe0d.mp3", "af_bella|At ten to two, the power went out. The whole gym was dark for five minutes.": "audio/en/s/d30df76f11c95f.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Без десяти два отключился свет. Весь зал был в темноте пять минут.": "audio/en/s/69c834dd779b48.mp3", "af_bella|When the lights came back, our laptop was gone. Our whole game is on it!": "audio/en/s/0bae2e7c883acc.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Когда свет дали, нашего ноутбука не было. На нём вся наша игра!": "audio/en/s/584506a1eefc04.mp3", "af_bella|A silver laptop with stickers. The deadline is in six hours.": "audio/en/s/c934b7d2138f40.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Серебристый ноутбук с наклейками. До сдачи шесть часов.": "audio/en/s/a96a7e0e8474ab.mp3", "af_bella|The door was locked. Nobody went out. So the laptop is still in this room.": "audio/en/s/f19017b80b250a.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Дверь была заперта. Никто не выходил. Значит, ноутбук всё ещё в этом зале.": "audio/en/s/5d49212fdf0cb5.mp3", "af_bella|Please help us. Talk to people. You have time until morning.": "audio/en/s/b0570486f084a8.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Пожалуйста, помоги нам. Поговори с людьми. У тебя время до утра.": "audio/en/s/fa51acd18fb8ec.mp3", "af_heart|Oscar was lying on the old sofa. He was wearing a green hoodie.": "audio/en/s/af57fd278ee0d5.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Оскар лежал на старом диване. На нём была зелёная толстовка.": "audio/en/s/94eb7cffa826c0.mp3", "am_fenrir|What? I was asleep. I was sleeping on this sofa all night.": "audio/en/s/f8aaa65ddd61a3.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Что? Я спал. Я спал на этом диване всю ночь.": "audio/en/s/1decb0f0d87c47.mp3", "am_fenrir|I didn't even wake up when the lights went out.": "audio/en/s/653d0e0f98c794.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Я даже не проснулся, когда погас свет.": "audio/en/s/2cb374c942ec0c.mp3", "am_fenrir|And honestly, I don't care about their game. Our game is better.": "audio/en/s/ce3b51ed884493.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|И, честно, мне плевать на их игру. Наша игра лучше.": "audio/en/s/2ff862f23ce433.mp3", "af_heart|On his laptop, you can see his game. It isn't finished. Only one level, and a lot of bugs.": "audio/en/s/14152537818844.mp3", "ru:af_heart|На его ноутбуке видна его игра. Она не закончена. Только один уровень и куча багов.": "audio/en/s/e3c4461eeb86ad.mp3", "bf_isabella|I was drawing in the corner when the lights went out.": "audio/en/s/48dc0a68e37bca.mp3", "ru:bf_isabella|Я рисовала в углу, когда погас свет.": "audio/en/s/88ab9d3654a6c8.mp3", "bf_isabella|I didn't move. I was scared.": "audio/en/s/16b4b68a06488b.mp3", "ru:bf_isabella|Я не двигалась. Мне было страшно.": "audio/en/s/f1ad453ccfcc1c.mp3", "bf_isabella|But I heard someone run. Fast. And then I heard the sofa.": "audio/en/s/ccfabcf1a68f85.mp3", "ru:bf_isabella|Но я слышала, как кто-то бежит. Быстро. А потом услышала диван.": "audio/en/s/2beef65a9a3c8b.mp3", "bf_isabella|That old sofa always squeaks. Like a mouse.": "audio/en/s/e2f8c41a4ba2d6.mp3", "ru:bf_isabella|Этот старый диван всегда скрипит. Как мышь.": "audio/en/s/f593606d294738.mp3", "bf_isabella|Why would anybody take our laptop? We're not even good!": "audio/en/s/da3985f57571c4.mp3", "ru:bf_isabella|Зачем кому-то наш ноутбук? Мы даже не лучшие!": "audio/en/s/763f4ef97ec1df.mp3", "bm_lewis|Yeah, I brought the pizza. I came at a quarter to two.": "audio/en/s/147fd849a63a59.mp3", "ru:bm_lewis|Ага, я привёз пиццу. Я пришёл без пятнадцати два.": "audio/en/s/ddc26786dd940d.mp3", "bm_lewis|A guy in a green hoodie took it from me at the door.": "audio/en/s/21502146b4ef40.mp3", "ru:bm_lewis|Парень в зелёной толстовке забрал её у меня у двери.": "audio/en/s/001f14bdafc094.mp3", "bm_lewis|He said: Finally! I'm so hungry. I haven't slept all night.": "audio/en/s/cc82e6a5844abc.mp3", "ru:bm_lewis|Он сказал: «Наконец-то! Я такой голодный. Я всю ночь не спал».": "audio/en/s/1fde1e545469cc.mp3", "bm_lewis|Then the lights went out and I waited outside. Zoe locked the door after me.": "audio/en/s/8d9deb00fd8e59.mp3", "ru:bm_lewis|Потом погас свет, и я ждал снаружи. Зои заперла за мной дверь.": "audio/en/s/55b00b78239635.mp3", "af_bella|The power cut? That's strange. This building is old, but the power never goes out.": "audio/en/s/ae3442c85bece6.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Отключение? Это странно. Здание старое, но свет никогда не вырубается.": "audio/en/s/ae22892b2cd185.mp3", "af_bella|The light switch for the whole gym is on the wall. Right behind that sofa.": "audio/en/s/0bdcf4d23e7724.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Выключатель всего зала на стене. Прямо за тем диваном.": "audio/en/s/7549d95eefda58.mp3", "af_bella|Somebody turned the lights off on purpose. I'm sure.": "audio/en/s/3af6047cd5a3ab.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Кто-то выключил свет специально. Я уверена.": "audio/en/s/c53eb7b30fd1c4.mp3", "af_heart|You look at Oscar.": "audio/en/s/26d039f1e55c1b.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Ты смотришь на Оскара.": "audio/en/s/ada682723be4b1.mp3", "af_bella|You said you were sleeping. But Jake says you took the pizza at a quarter to two.": "audio/en/s/f699291455f6fb.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Ты сказал, что спал. Но Джейк говорит, что ты взял пиццу без пятнадцати два.": "audio/en/s/569cd784906256.mp3", "af_bella|And the light switch is right behind your sofa.": "audio/en/s/70afafa519b71a.mp3", "ru:af_bella|А выключатель — прямо за твоим диваном.": "audio/en/s/f0cc94163601ce.mp3", "af_heart|Oscar was quiet. Then he took a bag from under the sofa.": "audio/en/s/d416f89a04cb48.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Оскар молчал. Потом он достал из-под дивана сумку.": "audio/en/s/6964bb3fe82bef.mp3", "af_heart|In the bag, there was a silver laptop with stickers.": "audio/en/s/b2af4e1c3a4c3a.mp3", "ru:af_heart|В сумке был серебристый ноутбук с наклейками.": "audio/en/s/1e84fcb4965aac.mp3", "am_fenrir|I'm sorry. Our game was so bad. I just didn't want to lose again.": "audio/en/s/a5ac3712881729.mp3", "ru:am_fenrir|Простите. Наша игра такая плохая. Я просто не хотел снова проиграть.": "audio/en/s/2c6c27254f9ccf.mp3", "af_bella|You know what? Help us finish our game. We need a programmer.": "audio/en/s/20f63e234e945e.mp3", "ru:af_bella|Знаешь что? Помоги нам доделать игру. Нам нужен программист.": "audio/en/s/9d8d3f1f67b916.mp3", "af_heart|At eight in the morning, team Blue Owl uploaded their game. One minute before the deadline.": "audio/en/s/42706b6c76161c.mp3", "ru:af_heart|В восемь утра «Синяя сова» загрузила игру. За минуту до срока.": "audio/en/s/df91b1d8635106.mp3", "af_heart|They didn't win. But they got a prize for the best team spirit. And Oscar's name was in the credits.": "audio/en/s/a57382e06b4508.mp3", "ru:af_heart|Они не победили. Но получили приз за лучший командный дух. А имя Оскара было в титрах.": "audio/en/s/edd5f0fcd6acb0.mp3"};
